Here are the definitions of PU that I have:
ba =3D after time tense relation/direction: will [selbri]; after [sumti];
default future tense
ca =3D during time tense relation/direction: is [selbri]; during /
simultaneous with [sumti]; present tense
pu =3D before time tense relation/direction: did [selbri]; before/prior to
[sumti]; default past tense

Each can be used with either a selbri or a sumti. I don't know if they can
be used without either: {mi ca gleki} (with selbri) vs. {mi gleki ca} (with
neither selbri nor sumti). With sumti: {mi gleki ca lo nu do zvati ti}.

stevo

